  Dashboard, Leads, Campaigns, Analytics, Settings, Users & Access, Invites

### Sprint 2A — Conversations Upgrade
- Unified SMS + web chat viewer, pause/resume bot, send-from-portal, AI suggest reply

### Sprint 2B — Dashboard Upgrade
- Hero story cards, conversion funnel, activity feed, calcTimeSaved, ROI banner

### Sprint 2C — Test Console Polish
- Full-width safe/live mode banner, collapsible demo script panel, channel switcher
  (SMS/Web), session state bar, stage badges, system event messages

### Sprint 3A — Leads Table Upgrade (2026-04-17)
- Filter pills (All/New/Contacted/Engaged/Converted/Contacted today)
- Slide-in panel with inline status select, auto-save notes, Mark contacted, View conv
- Channel badge (SMS/Web), `channel` column added to `leads` DB table
- PATCH /portal/api/leads/:id accepts last_contacted_at + channel
- GET /portal/api/leads supports filter=contacted_today

### Sprint 3B — Settings Polish (2026-04-17)
- General tab: 3 visual groups (Business Info / Contact & Notifications / Internal)
  with helper text on every field; added hours + timezone fields
