  with conditional field visibility
- Bot tab: Preview opener button → in-page preview (TEST_MODE) or Twilio send (live)
- Plan & Usage card: conversations + web sessions this month, usage bar
- POST /portal/api/settings/preview-opener + GET /portal/api/settings/usage

