## CLAUDE CODE RULES

For every task:

1. Keep scope small (1 feature only)
2. Write tests
3. Test locally
4. Deploy
5. Verify end-to-end
6. Update docs

Never:

* Bundle multiple features in one prompt
* Skip testing
* Break existing flows

